    "sections": {
        "description": "Agency Sphere is a modern Full Site Editing WordPress theme designed for businesses, agencies, startups, consultants, and professional service providers looking to build a strong online presence. It features flexible layouts, customizable sections, and clean, modern typography to showcase services, team members, portfolios, pricing plans, client testimonials, and business achievements with ease. Seamlessly integrated with WooCommerce, WPML, and Contact Form 7, it supports online sales, multilingual websites, and effortless customer communication. Built with SEO optimization, responsive design, and performance in mind, Agency Sphere helps you create a fast, professional, and conversion-focused website that effectively promotes your business, services, and brand. Demo: https://demos.themegrove.com/agency-sphere/"
    },
